Model weights
-------------

The fine-tuned weights (LoRA adapters and conditioning branches) are released
separately at https://huggingface.co/AppliedIntuitionResearch/BuildRome under
CC BY-NC 4.0, non-commercial use only. They are applied on top of the public
TRELLIS.2-4B base weights (MIT) and use DINOv3 image features (DINOv3 License).

The weights were trained on:
  SAGE-10k (https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/SAGE-10k), NVIDIA,
    Apache License 2.0.
  Indoor scenes generated with Infinigen (https://github.com/princeton-vl/infinigen),
    Princeton Vision & Learning Lab, BSD-3-Clause.
  About 4,000 synthetic outdoor scenes built with the pipeline described in the
    paper (Section on outdoor supervision and its appendix): scene prompts and
    plans from GPT-5.6, object completion with Nano Banana, object meshes from
    TRELLIS.2, ground layout from MoGe-3, and a SAGE-style layout solver.
No training data is distributed in this repository or with the weights.

